<title>UK: DG Hyp sets 100 mln mark step-up five-year bond.</title>
<headline>DG Hyp sets 100 mln mark step-up five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DG HYP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0	 MATURITY    03.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    03.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    HAMBURG   DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEAR ONE STEPPING UP YEARLY TO 4.25 PCT, 4.625</p>
<p>PCT,</p>
<p>		 5.0 PCT AND 6.0 PCT</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 771</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
